<title>UK: TENNIS-DFS CLASSIC WOMEN'S GRASS-COURT TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-DFS CLASSIC WOMEN'S GRASS-COURT TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, England 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the DFS CLassic women's grass-court tennis tournament on Tuesday (prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>First round</p>
<p>Samantha Smith (Britain) beat Park Sung-hee (South Korea) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>Lucie Ahl (Britain) beat Claire Taylor (Britain) 6-4 6-1</p>
<p>Kerry-Ann Guse (Australia) beat Annabel Ellwood (Australia) 6-0 6-0</p>
<p>Sandra Kleinova (Czech Republic) beat Alexandra Olsza (Poland) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>Sandra Cacic (U.S.) beat Shirli-Ann Siddall (Britain) 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>Cristin Torrens-Valero (Spain) beat Rika Hiraki (Japan) 1-6 7-6 (7-3) 6-3</p>
<p>12-Alexandra Fusai (France) beat Noelle Van Lottum (France) 6-1 4-6 6-4</p>
<p>Wiltrud Probst (Germany) beat 10-Silvia Farina (Italy) 1-6 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>Magui Serna (Spain) beat Nancy Feber (Belgium) 6-4 7-6 (7-1)</p>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>1-Irina Spirlea (Romania) beat Rachel McQuillan (Australia) 7-5 7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>7-Magdalena Maleeva (Bulgaria) beat Lenka Cenkova (Czech Republic) 6-2 6-1</p>
<p>2-Nathalie Tauziat (France) beat Kristina Brandi (U.S.) 6-1 6-4</p>
<p>4-Yayuk Basuki (Indonesia) beat Naoko Kijimuta (Japan) 6-1 6-1</p>
<p>5-Anne-Gaelle Sidot (France) beat Catalina Cristea (Romania) 6-4 4-6 6-1</p>
<p>Ginger Helgeson-Nielsen (U.S.) beat 16-Larisa Neiland (Latvia) 6-3 6-4</p>
</text>
